    "content": "# CrossAngle UX Enhancement PRD\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Foundation & Global Elements\r\n- **Tokens:** Configure Tailwind (`tailwind.config.ts`) and CSS with deep obsidian backgrounds, gold accents, and `Cormorant Garamond` + `DM Sans` typography.\r\n- **Global Navigation:** Build the sticky, glassmorphic dark header with logo (left), hidden hamburger (right), and distinct \"Book Consultation\" / \"WhatsApp\" CTA icons.\r\n\r\n## Task 2: The Immersive Hero (Section 1)\r\n- Build the full-screen cinematic hero wrapper.\r\n- Integrate high-res visual background loop/image with a slow zoom effect.\r\n- Add elegant serif typography: *\"Don’t just change your space. Change how you live in it.\"*\r\n- Add a subtle glowing scroll indicator.\r\n\r\n## Task 3: The Cross-Angle Perspective & Hotspots (Section 2)\r\n- Recreate the featured living space UI.\r\n- Implement the prominent toggle switch (**[ Angle 01: The Lounge ]** / **[ Angle 02: The Entry ]**) featuring smooth camera perspective crossfading.\r\n- Integrate 3-4 subtle pulsing dot hotspots on key elements.\r\n- Build the slide-out side-panel action showing \"The Design Move\" when a hotspot is clicked.\r\n\r\n## Task 4: The Transformation & Proof (Section 3)\r\n- Build the sleek \"Before / After\" interactive image slider layout.\r\n- Integrate floating client testimonial social proof elegantly next to the 'After' state.\r\n- Include the contextual CTA: `Get a Similar Consultation ->`.\r\n\r\n## Task 5: The Tactile Journey / Style Router (Section 4)\r\n- Build horizontal scrolling cards representing distinct \"Moods\" or \"Rooms\" (e.g., The Modern Wardrobe, The Minimalist Kitchen).\r\n- Add hover/micro-interaction logic (e.g., playing a micro-video of light moving across the room's surfaces or shifting a background gradient).\r\n\r\n## Task 6: The Final Invitation (Section 5)\r\n- Implement a dark, rich background section intersecting with a subtle gold gradient.\r\n- Add headline: *\"Your space is ready for its next chapter.\"*\r\n- Implement dual CTAs side-by-side: Primary Gold Button (`Book a Studio Consultation`) and Secondary Outline Button (`Chat with Designer on WhatsApp`).\r\n\r\n## Task 7: Advanced UX Mechanics\r\n- **Reveal Mechanics:** Add scroll-based parallax so foreground elements move differently than backgrounds, simulating 3D depth.\r\n- **Ambient Lighting Toggle:** Add a sleek button on hero projects to effortlessly toggle between \"Daylight\" and \"Evening Ambient\" lighting visuals.\r\n- **Macro-to-Wide Push:** Build the mechanic where a heavy macro texture zooms out on scroll to reveal the entire room layout.\r\n\r\n## Task 8: Mobile Optimization Overrides\r\n- Convert hotspot hover interactions to tap-to-reveal with large, thumb-friendly pulsing targets.\r\n- Implement an iOS-style bottom-sheet behavior for hotspot details to override and replace the desktop side-panel.\r\n- Inject a slim, sticky floating bottom bar containing \"WhatsApp\" and \"Consult\" that hides on scroll-down and reappears on scroll-up.\r\n- Convert the desktop Before/After slider into a thumb-friendly horizontal swipe carousel.\r\n",
